SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 50 taxa with 2 partitions and 29905 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	50	29369	169	0	29369	29369	Subset1
   2	DNA	50	536	299	86	0	0	Subset2

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: F81+F:Subset1,SYM+ASC+R2:Subset2

